# Sovereign AI: Standalone Desktop Suite

The Sovereign AI Ecosystem has been fully decoupled into a **Standalone Desktop Suite**. It is now a distinct, professional piece of software, independent of your web app builder.

## 🚀 The Standalone Experience

- **"Real" Software Feel**: When you launch "Sovereign AI", it is a dedicated management shell exclusively for your swarm.
- **Dedicated Port (5174)**: The app runs on its own dedicated engine, ensuring it never conflicts with your main web development on port 5173.
- **Sovereign Prompt**: The AI Command Bar at the bottom of the Terminal area allows you to talk directly to your swarm with zero API costs.
- **One-Click Startup**: Double-click the **Sovereign AI** shortcut on your Desktop. It will automatically boot the dedicated UI engine and the Electron shell.

## 🕹️ Control Center Features

1.  **Unified Telemetry**: Live streams from all swarm agents and components.
2.  **Maintenance Guard**: Toggle the swarm's warm-restart mode directly from the UI.
3.  **Intelligence Metrics**: Track swarm coherence, latency, and revenue gain in real-time.
4.  **System Tray**: The app stays active in your system tray for silent background monitoring.

## 🛠️ Operational Guide

- **Launch**: Double-click the desktop shortcut or run [.\SovereignApp.bat](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/SovereignApp.bat).
- **Remote Access**: Use Option 7 in [launch_swarm_v3.bat](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/launch_swarm_v3.bat) to bridge this standalone UI to your iPhone.
- **Development**: The UI source code is located in the dedicated `scripts/sovereign-ui` folder.

Your Sovereign AI Ecosystem is now a **standalone, elite Command Center**. 🌌
